    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "38941a683f0e2b9aa53aac398bd7cc30",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2134,
    "chunk_text": "I would like to propose three primary thematic areas in which Sri Lanka should move forward. We need to build world-class digital infrastructure by upgrading 4G to expand into 5G across all districts, incentivize telcos to invest in fibre-to-the-home facilities, utilize universal service funds to subsidize rural connectivity, establish data centres and Cloud infrastructure, including regional Tier 3, Tier 4 data centres around major metropolises, promote Cloud-first government adoption, partner with global Cloud providers such as AWS, Azure and Google Cloud in order to enhance our digital infrastructure, make Sri Lanka a regional technology hub, build an AI tech talent base and introduce a national AI and data science curriculum from grade 6 onwards, which is imperative for our educational structure.\n\nIt is also important to encourage inter-agency data sharing, government data exchange platforms and GD access so that agencies could communicate digitally. Real-time analytics for policy decisions would also enable efficient government in our motherland. Also, we must promote digital payments and encourage FinTech to ensure that we make cashless economy a reality.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0dc4\u0db7\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dba (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Chairperson) \u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dc0 \u0dc0\u0dcf \u0dc2\u0dab\u0dc2 \u0dc0 \u0d9a\u0dda\u0db8\u0db1\u0dd2\u0d8b \u0d94\u0db6\u0dda\u0db8\u0dc0\u0da7 \u200d\u0daf \u0d9a \u0dc0\u0dcf \u0dc0\u0da2\u0dd2 \u0db4\u0dc3\u0d9a\u0d9a \u0d9a\u0dc0\u0d9a \u0dc2\u0dab \u0dd2\u0db4\u0db6\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0db4\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb1\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dc4\u0da2\u0dd2\u0dca \u0db1\u0dda\u0dd9\u0daf\u0dcf\u0dc4 \u0dd9 \u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9c\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0bb0\u0bc8\u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb8) (The Hon. Sajith Premadasa) Let me take two or three minutes more, Madam. Ensure that the interoperable LankaQR is available in all businesses, buses, trains and markets and that digital payment adoption is used as incentives for small merchants. We must also promote FinTech Sandbox, including a Central Bank Sandbox for eKYC, digital banking and blockchain payments and allow responsible crypto-asset experimentation under strict regulations."
  },
