    "chunk_index": 147,
    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "7c279170c32f3114928502202af37354",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2110,
    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dc4\u0da2\u0dd2\u0dca \u0db1\u0dda\u0dd9\u0daf\u0dcf\u0dc4 \u0dd9 \u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9c\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0bb0\u0bc8\u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb8) (The Hon. Sajith Premadasa) Let me take two or three minutes more, Madam. Ensure that the interoperable LankaQR is available in all businesses, buses, trains and markets and that digital payment adoption is used as incentives for small merchants. We must also promote FinTech Sandbox, including a Central Bank Sandbox for eKYC, digital banking and blockchain payments and allow responsible crypto-asset experimentation under strict regulations.\n\nThen, startup visa programmes. Attract foreign founders to base operations in Sri Lanka and ensure that there are simplified company registrations and results-driven tax holidays so that those tax holidays would accrue benefits and advantages to our country. Also, ensure that university innovation systems are initiated and enhanced. Incubators within universities for research and development and product development must be encouraged.\n\nIndustry-university research grants must be enhanced. We need to develop digital trade and exports. We also need to expand the IT-BPM sector and grow exports from US Dollars 1.8 billion to US Dollars 10 billion by 2030. Focus on high-value niches, artificial intelligence engineering, cybersecurity, Cloud services, software product development, KPUs and legal medical engineering. Ensure that digital trade agreements are established. We need to include e-commerce, data flows and IP protection in trade agreements to make sure that those agreements are viable and genuine.\n\nWe need to enable digitally-powered traditional sectors. In agriculture, small irrigation projects, drone mapping and IoT sensors for yield optimization and digital market places connecting farmers to buyers must be introduced . In the tourism sector, digital tourism platforms, online bookings, cultural experiences through artificial reality and virtual reality, smart signage and automated visitor management in national parks must be introduced.\n\n2037 2038\n\n\u0dad\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dc0 \u0dc4\u0da7\u0dbd \u0d9a \u0db4\u0dda\u0db8\u0dc3\u0dc0\u0dc4 \u0db8 \u200d\u0dc0"
  },
