    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "95fa4bd0182dd80c54034aff768e1346",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2234,
    "chunk_text": "We need to enable digitally-powered traditional sectors. In agriculture, small irrigation projects, drone mapping and IoT sensors for yield optimization and digital market places connecting farmers to buyers must be introduced . In the tourism sector, digital tourism platforms, online bookings, cultural experiences through artificial reality and virtual reality, smart signage and automated visitor management in national parks must be introduced.\n\n2037 2038\n\n\u0dad\u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dc0 \u0dc4\u0da7\u0dbd \u0d9a \u0db4\u0dda\u0db8\u0dc3\u0dc0\u0dc4 \u0db8 \u200d\u0dc0\n\n\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0dc4\u0db7\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dba (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bb5\u0bbf\u0b9a\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Deputy Chairperson) \u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dc0 \u0dc0\u0dcf \u0dc2\u0dab\u0dc2 \u0dc0 \u0d9a\u0dda\u0db8\u0db1\u0dd2\u0d8b \u0d94\u0db6\u0dda\u0db8\u0dc0\u0da7 \u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dd2\u0dba\u200d \u0d9a\u0dc0\u0d9a \u0dc0\u0daf\u0dc4\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb1 \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0dc4\u0da2\u0dd2\u0dca \u0db1\u0dda\u0dd9\u0daf\u0dcf\u0dc4 \u0dd9 \u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0b9c\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0bb0\u0bc8\u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb8) (The Hon. Sajith Premadasa) Give me just one more minute.\n\nEven in the fisheries sector, GPS tracking, digital catchlogs, online auctions and weather alerts must be utilized. We also need to enhance cybersecurity and the trust framework. A National Cybersecurity Authority is a must in order to monitor real-time threats and to ensure public-private cybersecurity and defense. We need to implement the Personal Data Protection Act and GDPR style standards. We also need to ensure that cyber skills training packages are promoted so that cybersecurity degrees and certifications would be made at large scale.\n\nLastly, digital literacy for all citizens. Create community digital centres in every DS division and have free online courses on digital skills, coding, basic cyber safety. We also need to encourage women in technology with special initiatives for women entrepreneurs, freelancers, safe digital workplaces and introduce flexible remote work laws. We need, most importantly, to establish a legal and policy framework. We also need to update obsolete laws, modernize the ICT Act, the Electronic Transactions Act, IP laws and ensure that there are clear laws for digital signatures, digital contacts, Cloud data residency and online dispute resolution."
  },
